                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFDataDescription.DataDownload-alsoTypedAs"/>
                     <body>Co-typing: a DataDownload MAY also be typed cdi:TabularTextDataSet (delimited / fixed-width) or cdi:StructuredDataSet (XML / JSON). Represented in JSON-LD as an additional @type value (shared @id with the DataDownload), not a separate object.</body>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <lowerValue xmi:id="CDIFDataDescription.DataDownload-alsoTypedAs-lowerValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_description/1.0/xmi/#DataDownload-alsoTypedAs-lowerValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
